	In order to get the trail, either the Work must be grabbed, or you must be a member of the Read, Edit, or History Clubs."
	
	| retVal {XuEdition} |
	(self isBroken) ifTrue:
		[^XuEdition makeBrokenBy: self].

	Heaper problems.AllBlasts 
